Transmission 3.00 for Sailfish OS (dumpling)

Daemon: transmission-daemon, RPC at 127.0.0.1:9091 (no authentication).
CLI:    transmission-remote, transmission-cli.

Enable the user service:
  systemctl --user daemon-reload
  systemctl --user enable --now transmission-daemon

Then connect Tremotesf (or any Transmission RPC client) to 127.0.0.1:9091.
Download directory: ~/Downloads
